      "system": {
        "notes": {
          "player": "<p>The classification of Blessed ammunition covers a broad range of hand-crafted and sanctified ammunition. Whether they are bolts and solid slugs engraved with wards of warp-banishment, or promethium purified and consecrated with holy oils, or crossbow bolts and stakes tipped with silver, inscribed with prayers and devotions, blessed ammunition is useful when hunting the most impure heretic or warp-spawned horror. </p><p>Blessed ammunition adds the wielder’s Willpower Bonus (WilB) to the Damage when attacking a daemon or creature with a Warp Threshold.</p>",
