      "system": {
        "notes": {
          "player": "<p>Each handcrafted stake, explicitly designed for the Purgatus Crossbow, is carefully prepared through extensive sanctification. Each bolt is made of thriceblessed wood, consecrated in holy oils, and the purified silver tips are engraved with wards and runes that can affect the Immaterium itself. </p><p>Purgatus Stakes are used with the @UUID[Compendium.impmal-inquisition.items.Item.1dRwi7JTiuXS0vOm]{Purgatus Crossbow} only. Against daemons or creatures with a Warp Threshold, this weapon gains Rend (X), where X is equal to the wielder’s Willpower Bonus (WilB).</p>",
